_always"}, {"text": "I keep forgetting where I put things and I can't remember appointments", "frequency": "almost_always"}, {"text": "I got lost driving to the grocery store I've gone to for years", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "My family says I'm not myself anymore", "frequency": "common"}], "hpi": {"onset": "Insidious, over months to a few years; family often dates it to a specific event but on careful questioning it was already present before that", "duration": "Usually at least 6–12 months of symptoms by the time of presentation", "progression": "Slowly progressive and steadily worsening; short-term memory goes first, then language, orientation, and daily function", "location": "Not applicable", "radiation": "Not applicable", "quality": "Forgetfulness of recent events and conversations while remote memories stay intact early on; repeating questions; misplacing items; trouble with words, bills, and medications", "severity": "Mild at first and easy to dismiss as normal aging; by presentation it is interfering with work, finances, driving, or medications", "timing": "Constant, worse for recent information; often more noticeable in the evening or in unfamiliar settings", "aggravating": ["Unfamiliar places", "Fatigue", "Being rushed or asked to multitask", "Illness or hospitalization"], "relieving": ["Familiar routines", "Written reminders and calendars", "Help from family"], "associated_symptoms": [{"text": "Repeating the same question or story within minutes", "frequency": "almost_always"}, {"text": "Misplacing items, sometimes in odd places", "frequency": "almost_always"}, {"text": "Trouble finding words or following a conversation", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Getting lost in familiar places", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Difficulty managing money, bills, or medications", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Misplacing or forgetting appointments and names of acquaintances", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Personality change, irritability, or apathy", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Withdrawal from hobbies and social activities", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Trouble with orientation to date or day of the week", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Delusions such as believing things have been stolen", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Wandering or getting up at night", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Weight loss or poor appetite", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Visual hallucinations", "frequency": "rare"}], "pertinent_negatives": ["Stepwise decline with sudden drops", "Focal weakness, numbness, or a single-sided deficit", "New seizures", "Prominent visual hallucinations early in the course", "Parkinsonism before memory loss", "Abrupt onset over hours to days", "Fluctuating alertness from hour to hour", "Recent head trauma", "Fever or systemic illness", "New incontinence early in the illness", "Symptoms that began while starting a new medication"]}, "ros": [{"system": "constitutional", "positives": [{"text": "Low energy and reduced initiative", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Weight loss", "frequency": "sometimes"}], "negatives": ["Fever", "Night sweats", "Chills"]}, {"system": "neurologic", "positives": [{"text": "Short-term memory loss", "frequency": "almost_always"}, {"text": "Word-finding difficulty", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Getting lost in familiar places", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Trouble with calculations and planning", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Trouble recognizing familiar faces late in the illness", "frequency": "sometimes"}], "negatives": ["Focal weakness", "Numbness", "New seizures", "Tremor at rest", "Falls early in the illness"], "argues_against": ["Sudden focal neurologic deficit", "Early prominent falls or tremor"]}, {"system": "psychiatric", "positives": [{"text": "Apathy or loss of interest", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Irritability or agitation", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Depressed mood", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Suspic