tured"], "imaging": ["No intrauterine pregnancy on transvaginal ultrasound", "Free fluid in the pelvis"]}}, {"name": "Testicular torsion", "slug": "testicular-torsion", "why_considered": "Acute testicular pain and swelling.", "must_not_miss": true, "trigger": "Sudden severe unilateral testicular pain with nausea or vomiting", "discriminators": {"history": ["Abrupt onset of severe pain", "Nausea and vomiting at onset", "No dysuria or discharge"], "exam": ["Absent cremasteric reflex", "High-riding testis with transverse lie"], "imaging": ["Absent or reduced testicular blood flow on Doppler ultrasound"]}}, {"name": "Reactive arthritis", "slug": "reactive-arthritis", "why_considered": "Joint complaints in a patient with a recent STI.", "must_not_miss": false, "discriminators": {"history": ["Joint pain and swelling weeks after urethritis or cervicitis", "Eye redness or pain"], "exam": ["Joint swelling, warmth, and tenderness", "Conjunctivitis or uveitis"], "labs": ["Elevated ESR and CRP", "Negative rheumatoid factor and anti-CCP"]}}], "course": {"severity": {"mild": "Asymptomatic or minimal symptoms; detected on routine screening or partner notification; no systemic signs.", "moderate": "Symptomatic urethritis or cervicitis with discharge, dysuria, or postcoital bleeding; no fever or peritoneal signs.", "severe": "Ascending infection such as pelvic inflammatory disease or epididymitis with fever, pelvic or scrotal pain, and leukocytosis.", "critical": "Ruptured tubo-ovarian abscess with generalized peritonitis and sepsis; hypotension, tachycardia, and diffuse abdominal rigidity."}, "red_flags": [{"finding": "Sudden severe unilateral testicular pain with absent cremasteric reflex", "meaning": "Testicular torsion until proven otherwise; requires immediate urologic evaluation"}, {"finding": "Positive pregnancy test with pelvic pain or bleeding", "meaning": "Ectopic pregnancy must be excluded"}, {"finding": "Diffuse abdominal rigidity or rebound tenderness", "meaning": "Peri