o cut down or unsuccessful attempts; spending a lot of time obtaining, using, or recovering; craving; failure to meet obligations; continued use despite social problems; giving up activities; use in hazardous situations; continued use despite physical or psychological harm; tolerance; withdrawal. Severity is mild (2–3), moderate (4–5), or severe (6 or more)."}], "scores": ["ciwa_ar", "cows", "phq_9", "gad_7", "audit_c"]}, "differential": [{"name": "Opioid intoxication or overdose", "slug": "opioid-overdose", "why_considered": "Altered mental status, sedation, and respiratory depression in a patient who uses drugs", "must_not_miss": true, "trigger": "Pinpoint pupils with slow, shallow breathing or unresponsiveness", "discriminators": {"history": ["Recent use of heroin, fentanyl, or prescription opioids", "Found down with drug paraphernalia nearby", "Known opioid use disorder"], "exam": ["Pinpoint pupils", "Depressed respiratory rate", "Response to naloxone"], "labs": ["Hypercapnia with respiratory acidosis on blood gas", "Opioids or fentanyl on urine drug screen"], "imaging": ["Chest x-ray may show aspiration or pulmonary edema"]}}, {"name": "Alcohol withdrawal and delirium tremens", "slug": "alcohol-withdrawal", "why_considered": "Tremor, agitation, autonomic hyperactivity, and seizures in a patient who uses substances", "must_not_miss": true, "trigger": "Tremor, sweating, and tachycardia hours to days after last drink", "discriminators": {"history": ["Heavy daily alcohol use", "Last drink 6–48 hours ago", "Prior withdrawal seizures"], "exam": ["Coarse tremor", "Diaphoresis", "Disorientation and hallucinations in severe cases"], "labs": ["Elevated AST greater than ALT", "Elevated GGT", "Macrocytosis", "Low magnesium and platelets"], "ecg": ["Sinus tachycardia"]}}, {"name": "Benzodiazepine withdrawal", "slug": "benzodiazepine-withdrawal", "why_considered": "Anxiety, tremor, insomnia, and seizures after stopping sedatives", "must_not_miss": true, "trigger": "Seizure o