r-to-nose and heel-to-shin coordination, and gait including tandem walk", "finding": "Symmetric reflexes, normal coordination and steady gait", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "supple-neck", "region": "neck", "maneuver": "Passively flex and rotate the neck, and perform Brudzinski and Kernig maneuvers", "finding": "Full, painless neck range of motion without meningismus", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "essential"}, {"id": "normal-fundoscopy", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Perform fundoscopy to assess the optic discs and venous pulsations", "finding": "Sharp disc margins without papilledema and spontaneous venous pulsations present", "frequency": "common", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "periorbital-tenderness", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Palpate the frontal and maxillary sinuses and transilluminate them", "finding": "Facial tenderness or dullness over the sinuses", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "temporal-artery-tenderness", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Palpate the temporal arteries for tenderness, nodularity and diminished pulsation", "finding": "Tender, thickened or pulseless temporal artery", "frequency": "rare", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "temporalis-masseter-tenderness", "region": "musculoskeletal", "maneuver": "Palpate the temporalis and masseter muscles and ask the patient to clench the jaw", "finding": "Tenderness or hypertrophy of the masticatory muscles", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "pericranial-tenderness", "region": "musculoskeletal", "maneuver": "Palpate the pericranial muscles of the scalp, neck and shoulders", "finding": "Tenderness or tightness of the pericranial and cervical muscles", "frequency": "common", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "limited-cervical-rom", "region": "neck", "maneuver": "Assess active and passive cervical range of motion", "finding": "Reduced or painful cervical range of motion", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "conjunctival-injection", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Inspect the conjunctiva and eyelids for redness, tearing or ptosis", "finding": "Unilateral conjunctival injection, lacrimation or eyelid edema", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "nasal-congestion", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Inspect the nasal mucosa and turbinates", "finding": "Unilateral nasal congestion or rhinorrhea", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "normal-heart-lungs", "region": "cardiac", "maneuver": "Auscultate the heart and lungs and check for carotid bruits", "finding": "Regular rate and rhythm without murmur, rub or bruit; clear lungs", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "normal-abdomen", "region": "abdomen", "maneuver": "Palpate the abdomen for tenderness, masses or organomegaly", "finding": "Soft, non-tender abdomen without mass", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "no-skin-lesions", "region": "skin", "maneuver": "Inspect the skin for rash, petechiae or lesions suggestive of systemic disease", "finding": "No rash, petechiae or suspicious lesions", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "optional"}]}, "vitals": {"temp": {"mild": {"min": 97.8, "max": 99.1}, "moderate": {"min": 97.8, "max": 99.1}, "severe": {"min": 97.8, "max": 99.1}, "critical": {"min": 97.8, "max": 99.1}}, "hr": {"mild": {"min": 60, "max": 90}, "moderate": {"min": 65, "max": 100}, "severe": {"min": 75, "max": 110}, "critical": {"min": 90, "max": 130}}, "rr": {"mild": {"min": 12, "max": 18}, "moderate": {"min": 12, "m