e risk factor."}, {"test_id": "ldl", "ranges": {"moderate": {"min": 100, "max": 160}, "severe": {"min": 160, "max": 220}, "critical": {"min": 220, "max": 400}}, "frequency": "common", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Guides high-intensity statin therapy for secondary prevention."}, {"test_id": "hcg", "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "essential", "caveat": "Negative. Required in anyone who could be pregnant before CT angiography or thrombolysis."}], "ecg": {"findings": [{"feature": "rhythm", "finding": "Irregularly irregular rhythm without discrete P waves, consistent with atrial fibrillation", "frequency": "sometimes", "leads": ["II", "V1"]}, {"feature": "rhythm", "finding": "Sinus rhythm", "frequency": "common", "leads": ["II"]}, {"feature": "st", "finding": "ST-segment elevation or depression suggesting concurrent acute coronary syndrome", "frequency": "rare", "leads": ["I", "II", "III", "aVF", "V1", "V2", "V3", "V4", "V5", "V6"]}, {"feature": "qrs", "finding": "Left ventricular hypertrophy from chronic hypertension", "frequency": "sometimes", "leads": ["V5", "V6", "aVL"]}, {"feature": "other", "finding": "Prolonged QT interval that would limit use of certain antiarrhythmics", "frequency": "rare", "leads": ["II", "V5"]}]}, "imaging": [{"study": "Noncontrast CT of the head", "modality": "ct", "preferred_when": "First-line in every suspected acute stroke to exclude hemorrhage", "findings": [{"text": "No acute hemorrhage", "frequency": "almost_always"}, {"text": "Early ischemic changes such as loss of gray-white differentiation, insular ribbon sign, or sulcal effacement", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Hyperdense middle cerebral artery sign", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Established hypodense infarct in the affected vascular territory", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Intracerebral hemorrhage, which would exclude ischemic stroke", "frequency": "rare"}]}, {"study": "CT angiography of the head and neck", "modality": "ct", "preferred_when"