ntact lens wear with a red, painful eye raises concern for bacterial or acanthamoeba keratitis"}, {"question": "Have you had a recent cold, sore throat, or runny nose?", "category": "associated", "importance": "important", "looking_for": "Recent upper respiratory infection supports viral conjunctivitis"}, {"question": "Has anyone around you had red or pink eyes recently?", "category": "social", "importance": "important", "looking_for": "Sick contacts with conjunctivitis support an infectious cause"}, {"question": "Do you have a history of allergies, hay fever, asthma, or eczema?", "category": "pmh", "importance": "important", "looking_for": "Personal or family history of atopy supports allergic conjunctivitis"}, {"question": "Does the redness come and go with seasons, or after being around pets, dust, or pollen?", "category": "associated", "importance": "important", "looking_for": "Seasonal or allergen-related pattern supports allergic conjunctivitis"}, {"question": "Have you used any eye drops, ointments, or new cosmetics recently?", "category": "medications", "importance": "important", "looking_for": "Contact lens solutions, eye drops, or cosmetics can cause irritant or allergic conjunctivitis"}, {"question": "Have you had any eye surgery or eye trauma recently?", "category": "pmh", "importance": "important", "looking_for": "Recent surgery or trauma raises concern for a more serious cause and warrants urgent evaluation"}, {"question": "Do you have any genital discharge, sores, or a history of sexually transmitted infections?", "category": "sexual", "importance": "optional", "looking_for": "Gonococcal or chlamydial conjunctivitis in sexually active patients or neonates with severe purulent discharge"}], "accepted_names": ["Pink eye", "Conjunctivitis", "Viral conjunctivitis", "Bacterial conjunctivitis", "Allergic conjunctivitis"], "reasoning_points": ["Redness of the conjunctiva with watery, mucoid, or purulent discharge and normal visual acuity", "Itching favors al